values ('b4c5d6e7-8f9a-4b79-8c99-0d1e2f3a4b09', 'spanish-phonetics-and-pronunciation', 'Spanish Phonetics and Pronunciation', 'Spanish Phonetics and Pronunciation introduces the sound system of Spanish through articulatory phonetics, phonology, dialectal variation, transcription, and guided pronunciation practice. Students learn to describe Spanish sounds accurately, hear regional and learner differences, use IPA and recording tools, and design an individual improvement plan grounded in evidence rather than vague accent advice.');

